https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zDGr1GnXERc  (Capo 5)

TIP:  The song can also be played uncapo'd with (C), (F), and (G); or capo'd at the 3rd fret with (A), (D), and (E).  I just happen to think it sounds pretty in G capo'd at the 5th.

TIP:  The pacing is just a little tricky.  If you don't see a punctuation mark at the end of a line be prepared to jump right into the next line.  This is especially true in the chorus.


